aken it and he  probably would have been okay with it  but i don't want him walking away  feeling like there's a little bit even  that 20 cents creates a little bit of  resistance  so i gave him what i had i gave him 190  bucks  i don't care about the dollar 80 that i  overpaid for it it's what i had and i  was generous and i gave it to him  and then he's left feeling like evan is  a fair guy evan is a generous guy and  he's looking for ways to help me out  and if nothing ever comes back that's  fine too because it's the right thing to  do  so practice being generous and round up  if there's ever a situation where you  can't split something in half equally  give the other person a little bit more  you'll feel better they'll feel better  and more good things are coming to you i  can promise you  so practice rounding up  believe  you guys like this video  please give it a thumbs up below makes  want to do more and i want to hear what  you have to think do you round up right  now are you going to start rounding up  leave a comment below if you have a  question for your business leave it  underneath i'll do a video response i  really truly passionately love seeing  your comments come in so leave one below  thank you guys i'll see you soon

